  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "A whole Toxodon reconstruction with a deep barrel torso, curved front incisors and a low-carried head. It combines different specimens; tooth tips and soft tissues are restored, and the body form does not establish a semiaquatic lifestyle.",
    "zh": "Toxodon的完整复原，具有深桶状躯干、弯曲门齿和低置头部。综合不同标本，牙尖与软组织为补全，躯形本身不能证明半水生生活。"
  },
